{"parse": {"title": "冰原时隙-01", "pageid": 107408, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8E%AB%E8%8E%89%E5%BE%B7%E5%B0%94%C2%B7%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E6%97%B6%E9%9A%99\" title=\"莫莉德尔·冰原时隙\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">冰原时隙-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E6%97%B6%E9%9A%99-02\" title=\"冰原时隙-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">冰原时隙</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.80.E9.A1.B9.E4.BB.BB.E5.8A.A1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"一项任务\">一项任务</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 一项任务</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Mission</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>探索前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>探索后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang3\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang3.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang3.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang3.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在世界尽头最古老的严酷冰原，风雪会阻隔所有窥探的视线。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>即便是军人如鹰般锐利的目光也无法穿透南极的风雪，他不得不转向身后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>中尉，我们还有多少时间？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>铅笔在笔记本上写画的声音和雪粒敲击帐篷声混杂在一起，但很快就只剩雪粒的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>二十七个小时。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>为了平衡负重、尽可能扩大侦察范围，安德烈带领的侦察队并未携带太多补给。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>鉴于失温、复杂地形以及潜在未侦测到的战斗威胁，安德烈队伍的黄金救援时限保守估计为三十六小时。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>现在距离他们的预定返回时间已经过去了九个小时。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莫莉德尔结束计算，合上了手里的笔记本。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>安德烈的能力毋庸置疑，但我很担心戴维德……他太年轻了，还没来得及积累足够的经验。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>将军不会愿意见到任何一个孩子掉队。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>三人三组的搜救小队是目前能做到最合理的分配，我们必须抓紧时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>请协助我做好相应准备，队长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>是，中尉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他看向外面。雪粒还在不依不饶地拍击帐篷，只要有足够的时间，它们会磨平一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>我们什么时候出发？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>考虑到往返救援的时长，我们最多还有三个小时。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>三个小时内，只要暴风雪停下，我们就立刻出发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉同样看向外面，郑重地审视着这个看起来无法战胜的敌人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>如果天气没有站在我们这边，就在这三个小时内做好更多的准备和预案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>三个小时后，无论如何都必须出发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们的运气不坏，一小时二十七分钟后，敌人主动收缩了防线。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang1\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang1.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang1.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang1.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>暴风雪停了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>十分钟内做好所有出发准备，按原定分配计划拆分需携带的必要物资。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>是，中尉！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>请记住，无论能否找到安德烈小队，都必须严格按照你们收到的命令进行行动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>严禁超过规定探索时间，严禁偏离本队既定探索方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我会在集合点等你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉的目光逐一扫过他们的脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>每一个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>距离安德烈小队失联二十个小时。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang2\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang2.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang2.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang2.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>……不能再前进了，我们现在就调转方向，前往集合点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>可是中尉，我们还没有抵达原定的距离！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>如果遭遇恶劣天气，探索范围必须缩减，这也是出发前的约定之一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-519401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-519401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-519401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>报告中尉，我们还可以坚持！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉对他们的勇气予以认可，但对他们的提议进行了否决。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我们必须严格按照约定方针行动，停止前进，转向集合点执行汇合命令。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>可是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>在这样严酷的环境下，选择后勤物资分散负重的方式出动，任何失约都是对战友生命的不负责任。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉的语气严厉，认真地将行动守则向部下强调。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>服从命令，士兵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>……是，中尉！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莫莉德尔深深看了一眼雪原深处，带头调转了方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她面无表情，但南极的严寒出卖了那一声霜白色的叹息。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>全部九名探索队员聚集在集合点，开始有条不紊地搭建临时驻地。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>——是，是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我将在保证没有其他减员的情况下尽力搜查。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>是，将军。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>结束了与最高指挥官的通话，莫莉德尔慢慢地放下了对讲机，示意队长可以开始汇报。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>根据原定作战计划，我们将进行六个小时的修整，然后继续下一轮搜救活动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>中尉，六个小时会不会太久了？我们的时间已经不多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莫莉德尔低头看了一眼手表。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>保证大家的体力和找到安德烈小队一样重要，我们已经承受不起任何减员了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>距离安德烈小队失联已经过去了二十四个小时，中尉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>保守的黄金救援时间只有三十六个小时，如果我们现在休息六个小时，那留给安德烈小队的时间还剩多少？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉的睫毛扇动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>去掉修整的六个小时，我们还有四十二个小时。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>极限生还可能时限是七十二个小时，队长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我相信戴维德，他的意志像钢铁一样坚硬，他不会轻易放弃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>我也相信他不会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>现在，去吃点东西，然后尽快休息吧，队长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>是，中尉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我会再确认一下明天的路线和时限设置……在保证安全的情况下，尽可能扩大搜索范围。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>收到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>请早点休息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>感谢你的关心，队长。我不会违背自己制订的行动方针。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>距离安德烈小队失联二十五个小时。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_at_molideer2_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_at_molideer2_zone\"><img alt=\"2_8_at_molideer2_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2d/Cg-2_8_at_molideer2_zone.png/600px-Cg-2_8_at_molideer2_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"466\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/2d/Cg-2_8_at_molideer2_zone.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"840\" data-file-height=\"652\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在发出命令一小时后，莫莉德尔仍然没有休息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摊开在木板箱上的军用地图比其他人手中的多了一些标记。在代表路线的箭头前方，漆黑的手掌无声地罩笼着雪原。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>必须想办法在保证搜救覆盖范围的同时，避免和他们起冲突。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>现在是将军和他们合作的关键时期……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉陷入沉思，她看了看手中的合影，穿着芝诺军装的戴维德笑容灿烂，脸庞却稚气犹存。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>指尖压住的边缘隐隐露出一线鲜艳的橘红，中尉的目光聚焦在那里。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她把相片翻过去，然后收回到最安全的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>突如其来的细碎声响吸引了她的注意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>谁在那里？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在中尉的注视下，发出异响的不起眼雪层开始向外鼓起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-311520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-311520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-311520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>哇啊啊啊哦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">企鹅：</div><div>嘎嘎嘎——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我的头……嘿，伙计们，咱们这是到哪儿了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莫莉德尔轻轻眨了眨眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>三只企鹅，阿德利企鹅，南极常见本土野生动物。然后是挡在所有企鹅前面，谨慎地打量她的那只——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-312113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-312113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-312113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>一只松鼠？</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "冰原时隙-01"}}